	(text "For a USB-C Sink, C_{VBUS} <= 10uF\n- Another 90uF is allowed after the\n	over-voltage protection switch.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "02ddaf3e-0ef4-4236-bfb2-ec236195c019")
	)
	(text "Terminal Plug: C560212"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 134.62 90)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a5053bb-f0cb-4af5-8de9-ec240dcfe82b")
	)
	(text "One regulator provides powe to the ESP32 and the\nEthernet module. It also supplies the Piicodev\nconnectors (via a load-switch with 1.1A limit).\n\nThe other regulator supplies 3v3 to the IO connectors,\nso that overload/noise will not interfere with the ESP32.\nIt also makes routing simpler."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "16a3e483-1112-4009-95f7-7e9f2728c341")
	)
	(text "TPS2552\n- 5V 1.5A load switch (7.0V absMAX)\n- overcurrent protection (programmable)\n- short circuit protection \n- Reverse-voltage protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 -2.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "32b24cdb-f02d-43a1-9b1a-7b18bb5db7dc")
	)
	(text "Inefficient, but simple"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "32d95c74-4b84-4f9f-8e15-5a273792968e")
	)
	(text "Todo: add 28V OVP load-switch AW32905FCR (C401023)\nto protect the TPS2552 from voltages greater than 6.5V\n- Also provides ESD/surge protection (up to 120V)\n- OTG functionality allows 0V drop in reverse (like a P-mosfet)\n	- First the internal body diode conducts to 2.5V\n	- Then the mosfet is driven high to remove the voltage drop\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -2.54 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "342b40c1-a7b5-4511-91d4-562bee7955de")
	)
	(text "V_{IN} 2-16V\n(20V abs. max.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f64be3a-0c0a-4b73-9fdb-6badb960656d")
	)
